# Local artefacts that shouldn't ship to the repo.
#
# `runs/` is the per-arm checkpoint + per-step CSV directory. The root
# .gitignore already filters `*.pth`, but the per-step `*_losses.csv`
# (~5 MB / arm) and `*_attn_amplitude.csv` are bulky and never read
# downstream — every figure / table consumed from this experiment
# reads `results/`, not `runs/`. Drop the whole tree from the index.
runs/
